    "B0_workflow and B2_flat are the same primitive() controller, not independent implementations; B1_macro shares the same deterministic underlying heuristic.",
    "There are five labeled arms but fewer distinct strategy implementations. This does not establish benefits relative to five independently implemented baselines.",
    "Held-out destinations are instance labels, schemas are SQL table/column renamings normalized by the same provider, and longer compositions repeat the same primitive pattern. All use one SQLite family.",
    "Replicates change goal hashes without changing control-relevant behavior; repeated baseline runs across training seeds are paired controls, not independent training fits or independent task families.",
    "Task faults and goals are synthetic and operator-controlled. The scorer is a separate read-only SQLite connection in the same process and authority, not an independent external evaluator.",
    "UNKNOWN is implemented as no success claim, including known partial/unsatisfied stops. It is not solely an unavailable-label category; all final oracle goal labels are available.",
    "Optimizer records retain loss per step and final model weights, not Adam moment or gradient history. Exact deterministic retraining confirms updates but does not make absent state records present.",
    "Gradient check samples one coordinate in each of thirteen parameter groups, not every parameter.",
    "No process restart, private-state restoration, production FinalUse, real Notes provider, external field acceptance, retention suite or destination-family holdout is exercised.",
    "Arm execution order is fixed, not randomized/counterbalanced. Nanosecond timing differences are descriptive and not a controlled cross-arm timing qualification.",
    "Inference and training/collection durations are recorded; process elapsed includes nested setup, tools, oracles and output work. Do not sum nested metrics as independent total cost. Peak/resident memory, tuning/opportunity costs and recovery costs are not qualified.",
    "The primitive-frontier criterion fails before its additional full-cost requirement is relevant. No full paid-cost advantage is established.",
    "run2 repeats already exposed run1 task set and is not a fresh independent confirmation sample.",
    "This bounded negative result does not prove all learned hierarchies lack value.",
    "Only five distinct B1 macro decision sequences occur among the eighty confirmation instances.",
    "Inputs are ten hand-coded state features, not shared semantic foundation integration.",
    "Freeze timestamps are local records, not independently signed external attestations."
